{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"04d2461a33edcdc3bd7965a26a011bebac2f50d4eda93162bec0024904132280","ja":"手作りの雲","zh":"手工制作的云朵","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7405d6667035f85c41d71c81198560256c14742381a05165722d06ce4b0664ba","ja":"こうしてペットボトルのくもりが取れたら、準備完了！\n強く押しこんで、一気に力を緩めると……。","zh":"这样等塑料瓶的雾气散去，就准备就绪了！\n用力按压后一口气松手的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8e56b7ac57a8dedce6c50b8d5b4ed9d72745ecb8235778a1b0ac31d56d1ae795","ja":"あっ！？\nペットボトルの中が真っ白になった！","zh":"啊！？\n塑料瓶里面全变白了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"093f89ba4a0a5d090380c1ae74ebd9256d9e2b328fe123cff1b2e447687ca655","ja":"ふ、不思議です！　押すと透明なのに、\n離した瞬間に雲ができるなんて！","zh":"好、好神奇！明明按下去的时候是透明的，\n一松开手居然就形成了云朵！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"05703ef5011ca2537c7e10d4874273e3a0290aa4af86090ee1414cbcb52269f6","ja":"すごいでしょ！\nこんなふうに、水蒸気から雲ができるんだよ！","zh":"厉害吧！\n云就是像这样，由水蒸气变成的哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3e29fc92611b9baec447dcd9182b3959e5a7e6934a9a52b9185a54b90ab694ef","ja":"これ、すっごくおもしろいぞ♪\nできたり、消えたり、できたり、消えたり……。","zh":"这个超级有意思哦♪\n一会儿出现，一会儿消失，一会儿出现，一会儿消失……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"2e5473db0b2a46f0c566c29e82979c4df8e653235b1f8c99d8057f912272a97f","ja":"あっ。\n環ちゃん、そんなにすぐに何度も繰り返したら……。","zh":"啊。\n小环，要是这么频繁地连续重复的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c33ca9bac48042ff2b50fa79d4bc63f700e6bba0163cb378998727c31af38568","ja":"べこんっ！","zh":"凹进去了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"4e880c489ee61e2d1b0bb54d16d243f5a899119949b8168607098b12fb0a9f65","ja":"あ……あーっ！　つぶれて戻んなくなっちゃった～！","zh":"啊……啊——！压扁之后回不去了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6a14b4e904b628ff922cca201f42e2f23661fc111f50dba341f2fbabb6335e51","ja":"あちゃー。楽しくてついやりすぎちゃうのあるよね～。\nわかるわかる。ドンマイ、環☆","zh":"哎呀～。太开心了就容易不小心做过头呢～。\n我懂的我懂的。别在意啦，环☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"76ebd2b571623436c2a6d069feb1e2c533591badc74958618c8ff60993c78d06","ja":"勉強と実験を楽しんだ一同は、番組の締めに、\n蒸気船のおもちゃを作って、競争することに……","zh":"尽情享受了学习与实验的一行人，在节目的尾声，\n制作了蒸汽船玩具，并决定一较高下……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"77011187705916b4e9879ff6ad60d8593ead2038b6717a01042560b204f3378c","ja":"温まった銅パイプで生まれた水蒸気が、\n水を押し出して前に進む……不思議な仕組みだね。","zh":"铜管受热后产生的水蒸气\n把水推出去从而向前推进……真是奇妙的构造呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"58ac52e60d330b041db7dfa2aa4374ab50a476e74102b9eff16d559097527acd","ja":"最初に思いついた人はすごいよね～。\n……って、あれ？　星梨花ちゃん、何やってるの？","zh":"最初想到的人真的很厉害呢～。\n……哎，奇怪？星梨花，你在做什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1c3ddeebfc332c49e55afe502f19685983607f12b2744dd890ad7b22d15dc751","ja":"ジュニオールの絵を描いてるんです。\n船に乗ってるみたいで、かわいいかなって……えへへ♪","zh":"我正在画小朱尼尔。\n感觉就像乘着船一样，应该挺可爱的吧……嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"f6efd0dae642e4ad13b27e5e6101e5c84177b846e2cecf2e511570498e3035f5","ja":"それいいね！\n私も好きな食べ物の絵を描いちゃおっと！","zh":"这个主意好！\n我也要画自己喜欢吃的东西！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1652.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"bac93d45cb1d1023c723338ecf1a1b68d4d01cc542755a3f2bb978ced780eaea","ja":"桃子はどうしようかな……。","zh":"桃子该怎么办呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
